flowchart TB
    A[Uncertain Inventory] --> B{Contain Locally?}

    B -- Yes --> C[Pending Verification]
    C --> D[Verify / Reserve / Cancel with Explanation]
    D --> E[Small Blast Radius]

    B -- No --> F[Confirm from Projection]
    F --> G[Retry Storm / Duplicate Commits]
    G --> H[Mass Reversals / Credits / Support Load]
    H --> I[Large Blast Radius]
